1785548411201365	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyvwU		item.create	bn-3l5la	{"description":"# Context\nbn-1lfek paid the schema-side halves of many RFC flags; the owning RFCs still list them as open. Same bookkeeping class as the RFC 0026/0032 post-payment notes on trunk.\n\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Mark paid (with 'paid by the bn-1lfek schema sweep, 2026-07-31' phrasing, entries retained as record): RFC 0028 F1/F3/F4/F5/F12; RFC 0031 F1/F2/F3; RFC 0032 F8/F9 (and correction 10's example fix); RFC 0037 F4/F5/F10/F11 and the schema-half of F3.\n- [ ] RFC 0028's 'the schema's sixteen required properties' sentence corrected — content_budget is now required, making seventeen; verify the count against the schema rather than trusting either number.\n- [ ] RFC 0031 F4 annotated: deferred, schema-side half paid via required unit; a closed per-field reason vocabulary still needs RFC 0031 to mint it.\n- [ ] Deferred flags (0037 F1/F2/F6–F9, 0032 F1–F6) left as-is; do not mark them paid.\n- [ ] Dossier validator green.","kind":"task","title":"RFC flag bookkeeping after the schema sweep (bn-1lfek)"}	blake3:zg-_UUF7WYW2wnT8FpUV9cJQ7y1Y1P-kmp_4P1Y2Rr8
1785548411373151	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywAU		item.create	bn-13nlo	{"description":"# Context\nFound by bn-1lfek (fenced out there): schemas/examples/semantic-diff.example.json has before_intent == after_intent with non-empty intent_changes, violating RFC 0031's MUST that an unchanged intent uses the shortcut form. Fixing it means either deleting the dossier's only intent_changes demo or minting a second intent identity — which ripples into the promotion-receipt example's diff and policy story. An RFC-story change, not a mechanical edit.\n\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Example satisfies RFC 0031's shortcut MUST while the dossier keeps a non-trivial intent_changes demonstration.\n- [ ] promotion-receipt example stays consistent (correction 10: semantic_diff and intent_diff name the same diff_* identity).\n- [ ] Dossier validator green; schema mutant checks for the touched examples still reject what they should.","kind":"bug","title":"semantic-diff example violates RFC 0031 unchanged-shortcut MUST"}	blake3:wWg5sLnnhiYO0M2yp3TP-KFyKiVesRvMuFmqbtoasZw
1785548419592672	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywQU		item.update	bn-3l5la	{"field":"labels","value":{"action":"add","label":"docs"}}	blake3:_IjE-H-Tdb0smnkXXqPPyl_hdFelZ9ENyf2gO3yAXWQ
