1785548419711684	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyxQU		item.comment	bn-1lfek	{"body":"Landed @ 92a064c. All schema-side flag halves paid with no schema_epoch advance (draft-epoch rule); FR-01 lineage field exists (optional, interim evidence-graph obligation stands until required), FR-05 coverage typing done — the ratified counting rule is now stated over failing_neighbors. 32 mutant checks verified constraints reject what they should. Lead verified correction-10 fix (both diff fields name diff_demo1) and validator green in-workspace. Concerns routed: RFC flag bookkeeping (incl. sixteen→seventeen) → bn-3l5la; semantic-diff example unchanged-shortcut MUST violation → bn-13nlo."}	blake3:9cuZR15fhwXCTD7TzMacD96X4dYPuXwKmEFcP6F-OQ0
