1785549523909912	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy3wU		item.comment	bn-2siid	{"body":"Landed @ e8bde39. Pin design ratified: in_flight BTreeMap<ArtifactHandle,u64> refcount, incremented in commit_content's critical section, released via CommittedContent Drop (the single exit path); root set = index ∪ in_flight; receipts proven index-derived (appended in the same critical section as the index entry), so no receipt machinery — recorded in docs instead. Lead re-ran all suites in-workspace: 48+17(0 ignored)+6+3+1 green. The one modified reproduction (sharper witness) reviewed and ACCEPTED as strictly stronger: B's success is now the panic arm (which is exactly how the pre-fix store fails it), refusal asserted as IdentityCollision at CommittingContent, final read assertion verbatim. DX-13 back to Evidence (reference implementation); durable-store inheritance stays PR 6+ per docs/35."}	blake3:C0CbFJCdiNGNlTpJULlWC46aQGCL5-1ZnZdCFVmw4VU
