1785550110905288	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy5QU		item.comment	bn-1sh6	{"body":"PR-2 exit evidence delivered. New file crates/continuum-workspace/tests/pr2_exit_evidence.rs (3 tests, all green): positive (concurrent identical publication -> one identity, every writer receipted, schedule-independent across rounds), negative/boundary (artificial hash collision on byte-different payloads -> refused with IdentityCollision, never conflated, winner reads own bytes), boundary (same collision raced against collect_garbage -> bn-2siid pin holds, outcome unchanged). Module doc cites PR-2-EXIT and maps each clause to this file's tests plus corroborating pre-existing suites (src/publication.rs unit tests, dx13_falsification.rs, dx13_mutation_campaign.rs, continuum-value/src/identity.rs). No src or existing test file touched. START_HERE_IMPLEMENTATION.md line 120 now reads '...in certified lanes (delivered: bn-1sh6).' Traceability regenerated: PR-2-EXIT status flipped active -> satisfied. Dossier validator: status pass. cargo test -p continuum-workspace --locked: 71 -> 74 tests, all green (48 src + 17 falsification + 6 mutation + 3 new). just check from workspace root: exit 0, fmt/clippy/tests/boundaries/dossier/lean all pass. Committed as a2e6e12."}	blake3:jp6P_k17WJqyuavYuF6G4w_BDu7apqclrnIrlaz60uM
