1785552499200125	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyjQY		item.comment	bn-2i8	{"body":"Research done. Baseline 'just check' green in .maw/workspaces/bn-2i8. Wire form: dossier fixes no byte-level closed-set certificate format (proof-receipt.schema.json carries only {kind: closed-set, hash, path}), so defining a minimal versioned binary contract 'CONTCERT' wire epoch 1 derived from docs/03 §6.1 (certificate contents + checker steps), RFC 0005 (claim envelope, resource bounds), lean/Continuum/Certificate.lean (FiniteSystem.checkClosure — the authoritative semantic contract), and DieHard TypeOK (corpus TV-009) for the type certificate. Zero new dependencies, zero workspace deps (docs/03 §8 diversity: independent parser/decoder). Next: implementing src/{verdict,wire,check}.rs."}	blake3:bJ70a1BmBFDOsCl3OSQc84sueS0ANdHdGXjttd1XpTA
