1785553154905205	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEylwY		item.comment	bn-15gj	{"body":"IMPL-01 landed in .maw/workspaces/bn-15gj @ e8dd2d5. New src/snapshot.rs (2492 lines) + tests/merkle_snapshot.rs (708); lib.rs touched only for the mod line. Tree: root always a directory, BTreeMap<segment, node> children, leaf = file record framing content, interior record names children by ws_* identity — Merkle composition through the existing publication::ContentIdentifier seam (no second hashing discipline, no new deps). Ordering contract: segment-wise, byte order on UTF-8 segments, exact (no case folding / normalisation), documented as the seam IMPL-05 formalises. Equality and diff resolve by exact content comparison per ADR-0013; the root identity is a name, never a decision, and SnapshotDiff::identity_collisions reports every place equal identities covered unequal content. Snapshot::records() yields distinct records children-before-parents, so publishing them through ReferenceStore reproduces exactly these identities and shared subtrees converge (structural dedup = ordinary publication convergence). Versioned wire encoding with canonical-only decode (re-derives identities; rejects reordering, duplicates, truncation, trailing bytes, bad names, depth > 64). 45 new tests (33 unit + 12 integration) + 1 doctest, all green; just check exit 0. Annotated the START_HERE PR-3 IMPL-01 bullet '(delivered: bn-15gj)' and regenerated traceability. DECLINED to annotate plan 21 PHASE-A-DEL-01 ('immutable workspace and intent schemas'): Merkle snapshots alone do not deliver it — it still needs IMPL-02/03 for the rest of the workspace schema and PR 4 for intent schemas, and two other bones (bn-xd2, bn-1cw) already carry that label. Note for the lead: notes/plan/validation-results.json is now stale by one (active_requirements 754 -> 753); left for the post-wave regen to avoid conflicting with sibling agents."}	blake3:FkFPmE6q4pkT8_3famISD2xMmS8UbAaVDrb-6D6brmM
1785553249226892	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEymAY		item.comment	bn-15gj	{"body":"Landed @ f685cb7. Lead verified in-workspace: all suites green (81 unit incl. 33 new; 12 new integration), manual PartialEq on FileNode/DirectoryNode compares content recursively and never consults identity (ADR-0013 discipline confirmed by reading the impls, not the doc), decode re-derives identities rather than trusting the wire, records dedup by bytes so seam collisions surface to the store's exact comparison. Declined PHASE-A-DEL-01 annotation RATIFIED — Merkle snapshots are a fraction of the workspace half; IMPL-02/03 and the PR-4 intent schemas complete it. Seams for IMPL-02/03/05 recorded on the bone. lib.rs scaffold-prose refresh rides with IMPL-02."}	blake3:fMaJRLHdlZkV3VFGcduchpl5O3z0DqaRfAwMMTIAuxI
