1785553418497649	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEynwY		item.comment	bn-2i8	{"body":"Done, committed d8162d1 in .maw/workspaces/bn-2i8. Delivered: crates/continuum-kernel-core/src/{lib,verdict,wire,check}.rs + fixture.rs (cfg(test)) + tests/wire_form_boundary.rs. Wire form 'CONTCERT' epoch 1, big-endian, flat (no recursion), zero deps. Two families: finite-closure (kind 1) and state-type (kind 2). Verdict = Verified(CheckedClaim) | Rejected(Rejection, 14 reasons) | Unsupported(Feature: WireEpoch/CertificateKind/PropertyClass). 45 tests green (41 unit + 4 integration). just check exits 0 (fmt, clippy -D warnings, 300 workspace tests, boundaries, governance, dossier, lean). Annotated START_HERE PR-9 bullets IMPL-01/02/04. NOT annotated: plan.md phase-a-del-08 ('the four continuum-kernel-* crates') - only kernel-core implemented; kernel-sat/smt/temporal remain stubs (bn-n03, bn-15n). Non-test lines in kernel-core: 1867 (mostly doc comments)."}	blake3:2TJ3dTMOJtcL8brHAO4yOAISsfA62Lm__4Wtm3Xzk-M
