1785556718167728	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyrwY		item.comment	bn-1hrk	{"body":"Landed @ 911e481. Lead ran the full workspace suite in-workspace (141 lib + 10 integration suites, all green). Design ratified end to end: DiskImporter as the crate's only fs-touching type with iterative walk (adversarial depth costs time, never stack); overlay-as-set with typed duplicate refusals and base immutability by signature; fork provenance keeping origin/parent/identity apart; seal with per-record IdentityDisagreement check and no existence-oracle cache; diff carrying collisions forward. Component recognition v1 (Cargo.lock / rust-toolchain{.toml} / continuum.toml, ambiguity refused not preceded) accepted — Cargo.toml metadata-section parsing correctly deferred with the boundary reason. Empty-dir answer (skip + unrepresented_directories() disclosure) accepted. PHASE-A-DEL-01: workspace half COMPLETE (bn-15gj+bn-1qhe+bn-2xri+bn-1hrk); label moved to bn-u8z2 (PR-4 intent half). Stale-snapshot error is bn-3tda, correctly not conflated with diff::BaseMismatch."}	blake3:a2oS39pFssP6SUz18w9743e3Qn6FMzMOYh0NYnS5oIo
