1785559001640936	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyugY		item.comment	bn-3tkw	{"body":"PR-3 exit evidence delivered: crates/continuum-workspace/tests/pr3_exit_evidence.rs (3 tests, all passing) — clause 1 (fork+analyze independently, with exact store-convergence proof), clause 2 (old snapshot reproducible via store read-back after real disk mutation), boundary (sealed snapshot not stale merely because disk moved on; only lineage advance makes it stale). START_HERE_IMPLEMENTATION.md PR-3 Exit line annotated (delivered: bn-3tkw); traceability regenerated (PR-3-EXIT now satisfied); dossier validator passes; just check exits 0 (fmt, clippy, full workspace test suite incl. Lean). Commit 8fbc82e."}	blake3:e5jeChzBXcS5extUPvyY-c82JKorGCrczFDUSyHF7CY
1785559057568944	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuwY		item.comment	bn-3tkw	{"body":"Landed @ c13d3bb. Lead ran the 3 exit tests in-workspace (green). Standout rigor accepted: store convergence proved as EXACT identity/byte counts and receipt counts rather than inequalities; A's content read back through ReferenceStore::read rather than trusted from memory; the boundary test nails the heart of the clause — staleness has never been a filesystem fact, only lineage advance makes A stale. Corroboration citations into workspace_lifecycle.rs noted honestly rather than double-counted."}	blake3:SvCJ1694vNwVMhPc928b6QD5c-spHYH7oWcEZ2WYr-I
