1785595474322102	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyvgY		item.comment	bn-u8z2	{"body":"Landed @ f540bcd. Crash-recovery landing: agent OOM-killed twice; lead finished inline. Root cause of the session kills FOUND AND FIXED — the adversarial iff-tower test built its input by textual doubling (2^40-byte string materialized in the test itself); rewritten to one-sided nesting (1.4KB input, 2^20 expansion bound) which properly targets the normalizer's pre-expansion MAX_NODES check — and cpnf.rs's expansion_bound was verified CORRECT all along (analytic pre-rewrite bound, saturating). Also fixed: self-contradictory trailing-whitespace assertion (decoder deliberately accepts non-canonical spellings and re-derives canonical form — same tolerance as key reordering), two clippy warnings, fmt. Governance gate correctly caught the new continuum-intent→continuum-value edge; dependency-rationale.toml updated. 99 tests green (68 unit + 23 adversarial + 8 evidence incl. Die Hard from DieHard.ctm). Full just check green. PHASE-A-DEL-01 label → bn-ces7."}	blake3:GcEo-I7ZXL3Gg3ihpmaiCMXQYqYyXjW4gBEv1Rrxckc
