1785595551196161	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywQY		item.create	bn-185wn	{"description":"# Authoritative requirement\nPR-4-IMPL-09 — field-level change policy.\nSource: notes/plan/notes/START_HERE_IMPLEMENTATION.md PR 4 list.\n\n# Context\nRFC 0037's closed policy-verb set enforced per contract field: which verbs (e.g. no-decrease, no-weaken, frozen, free) attach to which of the contract's fields, with the per-field orders RFC 0031's classification is decided against. bn-u8z2 (properties, CPNF-1) landed the field identity/ordering discipline this hangs on; this bone delivers the policy types + enforcement surface. Design so RFC 0031's diff can consume it (policy verdict inputs).\n\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Typed field-change policy per RFC 0037's verb vocabulary (closed set, fail-closed on unknown verbs), attached to contract fields per the RFC's table.\n- [ ] Canonical serialization consistent with the crate's existing record discipline; schema-conformant (intent-contract.schema.json).\n- [ ] Adversarial decode + normalization tests per the house idiom; policy-verb misuse rejected typed.\n- [ ] START_HERE PR-4 IMPL-09 bullet annotated (delivered: …); traceability regen; validator pass; just check green.","kind":"task","title":"PR-4 / IMPL-09 — field-level change policy"}	blake3:9ZmI8psyJ5Uvl6jz5xA8oNOKhArVLROOlRw3lTTAR3Y
