1785597096636045	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy3AY		item.comment	bn-136f	{"body":"Landed @ 6ce09ac. Lead ran all crate suites in-workspace (91 lib + 36 new adversarial, green). Design ratified: FidelityProfile deliberately unordered (RFC 0002 profiles), DeclaredBound deliberately unordered (declaredness change has no direction — fails closed), BoundsRelation as the typed five-way surface matching RFC 0031 exactly, declaredness-moves-identity proven by test. Codec-duplication flag accepted → follow-up bn-3lfmi (extract shared pub(crate) expression codec once fairness lands its copy)."}	blake3:C1g0qGHke3INXiZPiCfHKKOWIqKxtDHeVRHq-Wosg4o
