1785601278481937	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy9gY		item.comment	bn-ces7	{"body":"Landed @ bb740cf. Lead ran all 20 crate suites in-workspace (423 tests; the 384 pre-existing verbatim). Ratified: the ten-of-twenty scope finding and the decision to model the six unowned groups inside contract.rs per RFC 0037's authoritative table (plan bullet list corrected with a prose note — not new bullets, which would renumber extractor IDs); the eighteen-key checked preimage; absent≡null≡encoded-explicitly on ID5's argument; the FieldDecodeError sketch declined for variant-erasure reasons; one-finding-per-(rule,group) as the composition-honest granularity. Findings routed: RFC 0037 defaults-paragraph tension + policy_reviewers absent-vs-empty → bn-16pyr; goldens-into-validator wiring → bn-1hg4o. PHASE-A-DEL-01 annotated delivered in plan §21 — both halves complete."}	blake3:qJzuR_ad_QTNfGP4WZFicAN9zaXY4ia_rlA38hszkVQ
