1785601278557039	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy-QY		item.comment	bn-16pyr	{"body":"Two more items from bn-ces7: (7) RFC 0037's 'Absence, null, and defaults' says 'no other defaults' yet gives scope.abstraction_level:null the same meaning as absence — implemented absent≡null encoded explicitly per ID5; RFC should state it. (8) policy_reviewers absent-vs-{} same resolution — reversing it moves every identity, so the RFC text should ratify the implemented reading."}	blake3:5hLhDYsw7NZS2G7x_v1mK3aX4s1G8CXO8Uam-h17yjc
