1785602217287111	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyhAc		item.comment	bn-16pyr	{"body":"Landed @ 46d1212. All eight items dispositioned: seven corrected in the RFCs/schema/example (corrections 12–16 in RFC 0037, 13 in RFC 0031, uniqueItems narrowing), one adjudicated-accepted (faults locator stays bare per INV-003 + fence — recorded as RFC 0031 flag F5 citing FaultUnit::field()). Lead flipped both pinning tests in-workspace before merge (change_policy_contract: the_dossiers_example_names_reviewers_...; pr4_exit_evidence: ..._is_schema_valid_and_well_formed) — all 20 suites green with the corrected example, trunk never red. Residual: five module doc comments still block-quote the pre-correction RFC text as open flags — rides with the next intent-crate bone (noted on bn-3lfmi's successor path)."}	blake3:EFbunCZ8PBqJNwjS-tlXGlyozsjDOWu2jlVwVhGOCn4
